title: Slow Dance
key: Eb
tempo: 66
meter: 12/8
style: rock

// The fifties slow dance in twelve-eight: four slow beats to the bar, three
// eighths in each. Thirty-two bars, AABA. The A is the doo-wop round, I vi IV
// V, closing on a turnaround that goes round it again a chord a beat. The
// bridge goes to the four, home, then the five of five into the five.
[A]
| Eb | Cm | Ab     | Bb7          |
| Eb | Cm | Ab Bb7 | Eb Cm Ab Bb7 |

[A]

[Bridge]
| Ab | % | Eb | %   |
| F7 | % | Bb | Bb7 |

[A]
